~20 minutes of the game.ChangesBumped up early game plant generation valuesReduced plant consumption by RuffeLowered breeding threshold from 25% plants bar to 10%Reduced the ominvore \"predator multiplier\" which encourages hunting fish fr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T16:06:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028640-1846651706684204","game_id":"steam-5028640","kind":"announcement","title":"Nordic Lake Developer Post 17th of October 2026","summary":"Introduction:Hello everyone!This might be your first time on the Nordic Lake page, so let me introduce TiredOakGames!TiredOakGames is a development \"studio\" name for a singular developer who has created Nordic Lake, with assistance from his brother for certain pieces of art. We are from Finland, and I have been creating mods and doing hobby game development for the past 17 years (started when I was only 10 years old).Now I work as a professional software engineer, but I have always wanted to rel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:38:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028640-1843481262699068","game_id":"steam-5028640","kind":"update","title":"Nordic Lake Demo Update 13th September 2026","summary":"Next Fest is getting closer, so I wanted to add some more content to the Demo!I have been working the weekend to add two suggested features to the demo, first we have a new invasive species: Canadian Water WeedIts a random unlock that will happen towards the \"middle\" of your demo experience, and can re-occur roughly every ~20 minutes. While it is invasive, it can also serve a real purpose in your lake, so if you want to have them, I have added a setting from the menu that will turn off the \"warn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T09:13:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699068","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028640-1843481262696183","game_id":"steam-5028640","kind":"update","title":"Nordic Lake Demo Update 11th September 2026","summary":"Thank you all for still trying out the Demo ahead of Next Fest. Hope you will have a great weekend!This is a short rundown of the Friday update, thank you for StormPE for great suggestions in the discussions once again, very helpful! This is a larger tweaking of the overall experience, and added some better explanation of what the status bars actually reflect. No new fish etc yet, but one might be added before the Next Fest demo :) ChangesCormorant will hunt all fish that are appropriately sized","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T18:55:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696183","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028640-1842846814451169","game_id":"steam-5028640","kind":"update","title":"Nordic Lake Demo Patch 9th September 2026","summary":"Thank you all for trying out the Demo ahead of Next Fest. So far we have gotten a healthy number of players, and thanks to all who have wishlisted the game! I feel very honored to have this many people give the demo a try!This is a short rundown of most balance changes, thank you for StormPE for great suggestions in the discussions! This should result in a better and more balanced demo experience.ChangesPredators prefer larger creatures, making for a more balanced gamePerch can hunt juvenile per","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T16:09:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451169","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5028640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5028640":"2026-10-26T07:16:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5028640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:32Z"},"5159440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:33Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5028640","app_id":5028640,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"77efe91e6ecd2193785f527275c8b17a34903b89d0b465342891ec7a9ec34059","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Develop your own Lake! Balance the food chain and make sure the lake remains inhabitable to all of its residents. Unlock over dozens of different unique creatures, including fish and invertebrates. Collect codex of all the plants and creatures as you expand your lake, and make it look your own.","publishers":[{"name":"Tired Oak Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Tired Oak Games"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comi